         "widgetType": "text-editor",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "<p>Every place has a story. Ours began in a small workshop with a borrowed table, a handful of tools and a stubborn belief that ordinary things deserve care.</p><p>Over the years the workshop grew, but the habits stayed the same: start with the people who will use what we make, keep it simple, and finish every detail.</p>",
